{
  "id": 1541,
  "description": "# Welcome in Seekers of None \n═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n\n### 🌐Guild Network🌐\n\n🔸Main Guild: Masters of None🔸\n\n\n🔸Other Guilds: Seekers of None (CL 1-40), Adepts of None (CL 40-60), Elites of None (CL 60-80)🔸\n\n\n🔸Banished/Cursed Guild: Exiles of None🔸\n═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n### ✅Requirements✅\n\n🔸Be Active🔸\n\n🔸Combat Level 1-40🔸\n\n🔸Participate in Raids🔸\n\n🔸Contribute to Stockpile and Challenges if possible🔸\n\n### 🚫Kick Rationale🚫\n\n🔸5 Days Guild Inactivity🔸\n\n🔸Rare to Low Guild Activity🔸\n\n═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n###  ⚔️Raids⚔️\n\n➡️ EVERY DAY: 2 Raids\n\n🔸Crystal Caverns (Level 25) 18:00-18:38 (UTC+2)✅ACTIVE✅🔸\n\n🔸Whispering Woods (Level 12) 19:00-19:33 (UTC+2)✅ACTIVE✅🔸\n\n##### ⚔️ EVERYONE PLEASE PARTICIPATE ⚔️\n\n\n\n═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n###  📦Stockpile📦 \n\nTake a quick look at the stockpile, see what we’re low on, and deposit what you can afford to help replenish it. These contributions help cover our guild’s repair costs. It’s not required, but even small and/or regular donations are appreciated. Only Logs and Bars can be deposited. Longterm Goal is to have 50K from every Resource.\n═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n### 📞Discord📞\n\nFor those interested here is a Discordlink for the Guild Server: https://discord.gg/Ea55kyPw2T\n\nRecommended for:\n\n🔸Information and Resources like Tools and Calculators\n\n🔸Raid/World Boss/Shrine alerts\n\n🔸Take part in Decisions, shaping the future of the Guilds\n\n🔸Ask us Questions regarding the Guilds or Game there\n\n═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════",
